            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "الوراثة",
            "explanation": "إذا \\(u_n\\ge3n+1\\)، فإن \\(u_{n+1}\\ge2(3n+1)+3n+4=9n+6\\ge3(n+1)+1\\)."
